OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Wyrmhollow
Description	Deep beneath the ash hills a great wyrm has slept on its hoard for an age, ringed by veins of living fire. Grow your dungeon along the old ring road, dig through the gate plugs and decide whether to wake the hollow. Heroes keep a small outpost in the north-east. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Wyrmhollow
SandboxTarget	56000
SandboxBonus	gold	30000	11000	-	Hold 30000 gold at once
SandboxBonus	levelAtLeast	3	11000	8	Raise three creatures to level eight
[/Info]

