[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Wyrmhollow, master. A great wyrm sleeps in the heart of these hills, and the ring road runs through caves nobody has claimed. Dig your dungeon first; the hollow can wait.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ring
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Ring
Action	message	1	The ring road starts here. Every hall along it holds wild creatures that will join a keeper with a full hatchery.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wall
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Dragonwall
Action	message	1	The rock grows hot. Fire veins run toward a great hollow, and four gate tunnels end a short dig from its wall.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hollow
Action	message	1	The wyrm hoard, master. Gold lies heaped on the dais behind a moat of fire, and three dragons watch over it.
Action	gold	1	500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ash
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Ashfall
Action	message	1	An ash hall with a lake of lava. Lava spawn and demons keep to its shores.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	outpost
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Outpost
Action	message	1	The heroes camp here and guard three coffers. Take what they leave behind.
Action	gold	1	400
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	spring
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Springhall
Action	message	1	A quiet hall with a pond. The cultists here will serve for gold.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hero1
Mode	once
Cond	time	900
Action	message	1	A small hero party is coming down from the north-east.
Action	spawn	2	82	14	1	Adventurer:2	Elf:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hero2
Mode	once
Cond	time	2400
Action	message	1	A stronger company marches along the ring road, master.
Action	spawn	2	82	14	1	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Adventurer:3	Wizard:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hero3
Mode	once
Cond	time	4200
Action	message	1	The heroes have heard of the hoard. A great host is on its way.
Action	spawn	2	82	14	1	Knight:5	Knight:5	Wizard:5	Elf:5	Monk:5	Adventurer:5
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	springhallWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	Springhall	claimed	>=	40
Action	message	1	The spring hall is yours and a spring of mana has opened in the middle of it. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	18	15	18	15	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
